Revision 30-01-2025
- Fix Issue #145 - remove the era:BasicElement and era:AggregatedElement classes and move the properties with them as domain to the super-class InfrastructureElement. Update of all the classes concerned by the hierarchy of InfrastructureElement based on sub-classes.
- Partially fix issue #148 with comment: topology is on micro level
- Changed the range of era:startOffsetFromOrigin and era:endOffsetFromOrigin into xsd:double and the unit of measure M was added for clarification.
- Added era:existanceOfIndustrialRisk property for defining the RINF parameter 1.1.0.0.1.1
- Changed era:linesideDistanceIndication according to the decisions of TWG for route book
- Added era:routeBookDataParameter for the route book parameters hierarchy
- Added domains for era:operatingLanguage and era:operationalRegimeType
- Added hierarchy for generic route book related parameter
- Remove the era:SignalsGrid and all the relations, following the request during a bilateral meeting with Infrabel
- remove redundant era:kilometerNumber and add more details on era:kilometer
- Fix issue #104 - adding era:carrierLinearElement

Revision 13-12-2024
